{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>29歲足球主播兼歌手鄭杞瑤Kylie C.近日遠赴越南旅遊，在當地一間知名米芝蓮餐廳大歎高級料理時，以一身極具視覺衝擊力的打扮驚艷全場。她不但未有因為身處高級食府而收起性感，反而大方展露魔鬼身材，惹來大批網民瘋狂洗版。這輯震驚球迷的火辣照片一出，隨即在網絡上掀起一場關於衣著尺度的激烈討論。Kylie C.現身越南...</p>\n<p>\n29歲足球主播兼歌手鄭杞瑤Kylie C.近日遠赴越南旅遊，在當地一間知名米芝蓮餐廳大歎高級料理時，以一身極具視覺衝擊力的打扮驚艷全場。她不但未有因為身處高級食府而收起性感，反而大方展露魔鬼身材，惹來大批網民瘋狂洗版。這輯震驚球迷的火辣照片一出，隨即在網絡上掀起一場關於衣著尺度的激烈討論。\n</p>\n<h2>Kylie C.現身越南米芝蓮餐廳大歎美食</h2>\n<p>鄭杞瑤Kylie C.前往越南旅遊放鬆期間，特別造訪了當地榮獲米芝蓮綠星榮譽的高級餐廳Nén Danang品嚐現代料理。當晚她身穿一件白色掛頸短身上衣，搭配低腰牛仔褲，大方曬出清晰可見馬甲線與迷人鎖骨。該件上衣採用極度深V剪裁設計，直接將豐滿上圍及事業線展露無遺，營造出極具衝擊力的視覺效果，而相片背景則展示了餐廳內部的環境與多道精美食物。</p>\n<h2>Kylie C.無懼目光大方展現個人自信</h2>\n<p>面對這身震撼眼球衣著打扮惹來的關注，當事人未有刻意閃避，反而透過個人社交平台公開分享這系列在餐廳內外拍攝的惹火影像。相片中她對著鏡頭擺出各種傲人姿勢，全程散發出滿滿自信魅力。事實上，她過去曾經公開表達過自己對衣著打扮的看法，並向外界表示「著咩都可以好性感」，直接陳述了她對於選擇服裝及展露天賦本錢的個人立場。</p>\n<h2>忠實阿仙奴球迷擁有歌手等多重身分</h2>\n<p>現年29歲鄭杞瑤Kylie C.一直在男球迷心目中擁有極高討論度，除了是一名稱職足球主播外，同時亦擁有歌手身分。身為英超球會阿仙奴忠實粉絲，她平日講述足球賽事時展現出專業知識，令她在男性主導足球圈子中突圍而出。她日常經常在社交平台向粉絲大派福利照，即使換上普通日常便服亦同樣吸引目光，每次更新動態都會吸引大批球迷密切留意及點讚。</p>\n<h2>震撼視覺衝擊惹大批網民驚呼太犯規</h2>\n<p>這輯在越南拍攝的中門大開辣照曝光後，迅速吸引大量網民湧入留言區熱烈討論，焦點全落在她極度誇張的身材及衣著打扮上。大批網民對其深V造型感到極大震撼，紛紛留言驚嘆「誇張」以及「好靚」。更有激動粉絲在帖文下方留下「太犯規，簡直係殺人，唔使用劍」的評價，直接以文字表達對這套服裝殺傷力的強烈感受。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403077267768_373122246adacc3fad353.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792584869_4012813476081047850_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403077267768_373122246adacc3fad353.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：G@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403449442547_15412666516adacc42b41b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1792584869_4012813485745019786_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179272403449442547_15412666516adacc42b41b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：G@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125870539459_6231284156ac9d6ab750c8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125870539459_6231284156ac9d6ab750c8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kylie C以性感見稱，身材出眾（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125993949749_12911211226ac9d6b7d5a30.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17916125993949749_12911211226ac9d6b7d5a30.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161259167458759_14178794196ac9d6b07f0e0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161259167458759_14178794196ac9d6b07f0e0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>她坦言希望大家留意其內涵。網民不睇好表示：「同叫人唔好留意美斯球技有咩分別」（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161258943916797_16038786346ac9d6ae25346.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179161258943916797_16038786346ac9d6ae25346.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>以前好多福利（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178209804238094662_18329332556a38a87b10339.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"ckykylie_1779976016_3907044332413274601_20002748.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/178209804238094662_18329332556a38a87b10339.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ig@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/img_6155_104301126167357b023e79f-1024x1407.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KylieC 鄭杞瑤 （圖片來源：ig@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/img_6155_104301126167357b023e79f-1024x1407.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：ig@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/img_8545_12403989746846eda50c4bb-1024x740.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KylieC 鄭杞瑤 （圖片來源：youtube@YS LABELS）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/img_8545_12403989746846eda50c4bb-1024x740.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：youtube@YS LABELS）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976921905084042_395587618697c8903479ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"KylieC 鄭杞瑤 Kylie C.今年初出演ViuTV綜藝《足球女將》，並憑住對足球嘅認真獲唔少網民力讚！（圖片來源： IG＠ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976921905084042_395587618697c8903479ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kylie C.出演ViuTV綜藝《足球女將》，並憑住對足球嘅認真獲唔少網民力讚！（圖片來源： IG＠ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922422822276_1170638743697c890864dca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c （圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922422822276_1170638743697c890864dca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922358760071_1168632415697c8907c3990.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c 藍色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922358760071_1168632415697c8907c3990.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>藍色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922479058822_593936931697c890910270.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c 黃色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/176976922479058822_593936931697c890910270.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>黃色。（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/vs-instagram-013_759461551679ec9b5334fb-1024x1320.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kylie c （圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/vs-instagram-013_759461551679ec9b5334fb-1024x1320.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ckykylie）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T03:05:17.703646+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1612,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T02:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T03:38:19.594224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:58:20.517630+00:00","content_hash":"0901d83878d5868dbb36b96466bb3c16c1d110ddee55c9ba15db68efb18c3531","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}